/*
 * Declares the MacroCtorSymbol class.
 *
 * A macro constructor represents the macro expression created when invoking a
 * macro. It is the entry point of macro resolution: the constructor is
 * progressively decomposed and rewritten according to the macro rules defined
 * in the macro declaration.
 *
 * MacroCtorSymbol stores the syntactic rule used to construct the macro
 * expression and provides the symbolic identity used during semantic analysis.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::macro_::constructor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/macro_/constructor.yr
 * @Author(s):
